  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.concorindia.co.in/recruitment-notice?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Container Corporation of India Ltd. (CONCOR)</a> </span>has released the notification for the post of <strong>MT, Assistant</strong>. This recruitment has been issued for <strong>77 posts</strong>. The online application process for <strong>CONCOR MT, Assistant Officer&nbsp;Recruitment 2026</strong> has started from <strong>31 August 2026</strong>, and candidates can apply till <strong>30 September 2026</strong>. Candidates must check the complete details for <strong>CONCOR MT, Assistant Officer&nbsp;Recruitment 2026</strong>, which are given below.</span></p>\n<div class=\"code-block code-block-2\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Container Corporation of India Ltd. (CONCOR)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">CONCOR MT, Assistant Officer Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start Date : <strong>31 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>30 September 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size