font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (MIS)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">03</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (Civil)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (Personnel &amp; Administration)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (Commercial &amp; Operations)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">20</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (Accounts)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (Technical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (MIS)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">02</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (Civil)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>CONCOR MT, Assistant Officer Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Educational Qualification</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (Commercial &amp; Operations)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Graduate with (55% Marks) and 02 Years MBA or Equivalent PG Degree or Diploma with specialization in Marketing/ International Business/ Operations/ Logistics/ Supply Chain Management with (60% Marks).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (Accounts)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Graduate with (55% Marks) and qualified Chartered Accountant.&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (Accounts)/Compliance</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Graduate with (55% Marks) and qualified Company Secretary.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (Technical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Bachelor’s Degree in Engineering in Mechanical / Electrical/ Electronics with (60% Marks).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (MIS)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a B.E /B.Tech (Computer Engg./ Computer Science)/ MCA/ M.Sc(IT) / M.Sc (Computer Science)/ DOEACC B Level (60% Marks).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (Civil)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Bachelor’s Degree in Civil Engineering with (60% Marks).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Management Trainee (Personnel &amp; Administration)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Graduate with (55% Marks) and 02 Years MBA/MSW or Equivalent PG Degree or Diploma with specialization in HRM/ Personnel Management/ Industrial Relations with (60% Marks).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (Commercial &amp; Operations)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Graduate with (50% Marks) and 04 Years Experience OR 2 Years (for candidates having Institute of Rail Transport Diploma in multi modal transport or any other special course of minimum one year in shipping/logistics/ Trade along with qualification as mentioned above).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (Accounts)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a B. Com with (50% Marks) and 04 Years Experience OR 2 Years (for candidates qualified in CA(Inter)/CMA (Inter) along with qualification as mentioned above.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (Technical)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Diploma/Bachelor’s Degree in Mechanical/ Electrical/ Electronics with (50% Marks) and 3 Years Experience for candidates having diploma OR 1 Year (for candidates having Bachelor’s Degree in Engineering in Mechanical/ Electrical/Civil/Electronics with minimum 50% marks in aggregate from any university or institute duly approved by Govt / recognized by AICTE/ UGC).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (MIS)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Graduate with PGDCA or BCA or B.Sc (Hons) in Computer Science or DOEACC ‘A’ Level with (50% Marks) and 3 Years Experience (in IT support, software applications in reputed company), OR 1 Year (for candidates having MCA Degree/B.Tech/ BE (Computer Science/Computer Engg.)/ M.Sc (IT)/ M.Sc (Computer Science)/ DOEACC B level with minimum 50% marks).</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.8414%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Assistant Officer (Civil)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.1586%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must have a Bachelor’s Degree / Diploma in Civil Engineering with (50% Marks) and 1 Year Experience for candidates having Bachelor’s Degree in Civil Engineering &amp; 3 Years for candidates having Diploma in Civil Engineering.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>CONCOR MT, Assistant Officer Online Form 2026 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://www.concorindia.co.in/recruitment-notice?lang=hi or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the CONCOR before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">You Can Check other &nbsp;Notification Here – </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for CONCOR MT, Assistant Officer recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Note – छात्रो से ये अनुरोध किया जाता है की वो अपना फॉर्म भरने से पहले Official Notification (Last Date, Age Limit, Qualification) को ध्यान से जरूर पढे उसके बाद ही अपना फॉर्म भरे।</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>CONCOR MT, Assistant Officer Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In